{"blocks":[["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1390","postStartCommand and postAttachCommand are for ongoing use.",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Key Principles","Some hooks are creation-time, others are runtime"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1459","Idempotence becomes more important later in the lifecycle",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Key Principles"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1525","Commands that run on every start or attach should tolerate repetition.",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Key Principles","Idempotence becomes more important later in the lifecycle"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1601","Hook Families",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1621","Before the container exists",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Hook Families"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1657","DevContainer/Hook/initializeCommand",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Hook Families","Before the container exists"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1702","Runs on the host before the container is created or built.",["Hook Families","Before the container exists","DevContainer/Hook/initializeCommand"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1767","Best for pre-flight checks, generating files, or preparing local inputs that the build depends on.",["Hook Families","Before the container exists","DevContainer/Hook/initializeCommand"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1872","During first-time environment creation",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Hook Families"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1919","DevContainer/Hook/onCreateCommand",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Hook Families","During first-time environment creation"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-1962","Runs inside the container only once, after the container is created and started for the first time.",["Hook Families","During first-time environment creation","DevContainer/Hook/onCreateCommand"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-2068","Best for one-time bootstrap tasks.",["Hook Families","During first-time environment creation","DevContainer/Hook/onCreateCommand"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-2109","DevContainer/Hook/updateContentCommand",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Hook Families","During first-time environment creation"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-2157","Runs inside the container when workspace content changes during creation workflows.",["Hook Families","During first-time environment creation","DevContainer/Hook/updateContentCommand"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-2247","This is mainly relevant in flows like GitHub Codespaces prebuilds, where the image and repository content can arrive in different stages.",["Hook Families","During first-time environment creation","DevContainer/Hook/updateContentCommand"]],["DevContainer/Hook/","source-block-2391","DevContainer/Hook/postCreateCommand",["DevContainer Hooks Conceptual Overview","Hook Families","During first-time environment creation"]]],"format_version":5}